## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ability to architect privacy-preserving, low-latency ML systems at scale, including RAG, edge adaptation, and robust evaluation.

## Key Concepts
- Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)
- DP-SGD and Secure Aggregation
- Federated Learning (FL) with edge adaptation
- Latency budgets and edge deployment
- Drift detection and rollout strategy

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo DP-FL update sketch
for (device of devices) {
  const g = computeGradients(device.localData, model);
  const gDP = applyDifferentialPrivacy(g, epsilon);
  sendToServer(gDP);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you handle user opt-out data policies in FL and on-device learning?
- How would you measure and mitigate concept drift across enterprise domains?
